# This file explains the fix for the JSON.hpp compilation errors

The error comes from:
flutter_secure_storage_linux -> json.hpp (C++ dependency)

The issue: Newer C++ compilers treat deprecated literal operators as errors with -Werror

Solution: Modify the CMakeLists.txt to not treat warnings as errors

In your CMakeLists.txt, find the line that sets compiler flags and modify:
-Werror should be removed or -Wno-deprecated-literal-operator should be added
